WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:40.490 --> 01:44.080
Bow down, bow down!

01:50.420 --> 01:52.590
Wow!

01:56.090 --> 01:59.140
This is pretty real!

01:59.140 --> 01:59.970
Let's go!

02:02.640 --> 02:04.390
Hold on!

02:04.390 --> 02:06.520
What is it?

02:06.520 --> 02:08.520
We must check your passport.

02:08.520 --> 02:09.770
Passport?

02:09.770 --> 02:12.360
Do they mean the entrance ticket?

02:12.360 --> 02:14.780
Looks like the security system is perfect!

02:25.490 --> 02:27.290
Beautiful...

02:28.540 --> 02:32.000
Thank you for the trouble. Open the gates!

02:33.340 --> 02:34.590
I'm first!

02:34.590 --> 02:37.130
Maron! That's not fair! I'm first!

02:39.590 --> 02:42.050
It seems like I'm really in the Edo Era.

02:42.050 --> 02:44.060
Look! Look! They even have a castle!

02:59.070 --> 03:02.030
It looks like we have intruders.

03:03.700 --> 03:06.660
They're like insects buzzing around a campfire!

03:10.620 --> 03:17.260
Infiltration! Mechanical Ninja Castle

03:17.670 --> 03:21.930
Now, everyone. Please change into your costumes here.

03:21.930 --> 03:25.970
The fee is included with the passport, meaning it's free.

03:27.720 --> 03:32.350
My, my, Master Hachori. It fits you so well!

03:32.350 --> 03:36.320
Really? This is the police style of the Edo Era, isn't it?

03:36.320 --> 03:39.860
Yes, it is. And your underling...?

03:39.860 --> 03:42.070
Class President, hurry up!

03:42.070 --> 03:43.820
But I-I...

03:45.030 --> 03:46.950
This outfit is...

03:48.330 --> 03:50.540
This is another good fit!

03:50.540 --> 03:52.120
Really?

03:52.120 --> 03:53.580
You're under arrest!

03:53.580 --> 03:54.420
Just kidding.

03:56.340 --> 03:57.710
What a couple!

04:05.340 --> 04:07.720
I guess this <i>is</i> a match.

04:07.720 --> 04:11.850
A tomboy city girl and a happy-go-lucky playboy.

04:11.850 --> 04:14.060
Who are you calling a tomboy?!

04:14.060 --> 04:15.770
Happy-go-lucky???

04:15.770 --> 04:22.490
Whoa, whoa! Calm down. We can exchange our money over there. Let's go!

04:22.490 --> 04:24.610
Okay, Hachi! Follow me!

04:24.610 --> 04:29.240
Hachi? Um, I'm Minazuki...

04:29.240 --> 04:33.500
Underlings are always called Hachibei...

04:33.500 --> 04:34.790
Any complaints?!

04:34.790 --> 04:36.210
None at all!

04:43.590 --> 04:45.720
This is fun!

04:45.720 --> 04:48.760
I wish I could wear such a beautiful kimono.

04:48.760 --> 04:51.140
Emergency! Emergency! Emergency!

04:51.140 --> 04:53.850
What? What's going on?!

04:53.850 --> 04:55.310
Move it! Move it!

04:56.400 --> 04:57.980
It's Access!

04:57.980 --> 04:59.020
Hey, Fin-chan!

05:02.900 --> 05:05.110
He fell...

05:05.110 --> 05:08.070
But why would Access be here?

05:08.070 --> 05:11.370
Could there be a Demon in this city? Oh no!

05:23.210 --> 05:25.510
Looks like I've found myself a small fry.

05:25.510 --> 05:28.720
She's like a moth to a flame!

05:31.600 --> 05:34.520
Oh man. I'm starving!

05:34.520 --> 05:37.770
This is a really boring place.

05:37.770 --> 05:41.690
The pamphlet said there'd be lots of events...

05:41.690 --> 05:43.860
Why don't we take a break?

05:43.860 --> 05:45.400
What are you talking about?

05:45.400 --> 05:50.830
We have to go see the Police Station Oobanya and the Prison at Kotenmacho first!

05:50.830 --> 05:54.580
Geez, Miyako. We've been going to all kinds of places...

05:56.580 --> 05:58.370
It's a <i>kinchakukiri!</i>

05:59.250 --> 06:00.630
"Kinchakukiri?"

06:00.630 --> 06:03.340
I think they mean pickpocket.

06:03.340 --> 06:05.920
Then it's time to roll! Let's go, Hachi!

06:05.920 --> 06:07.170
Toudaiji-san!

06:07.170 --> 06:08.680
Call me "Boss!"

06:12.220 --> 06:14.390
You're under arrest!

06:14.390 --> 06:15.270
Damn!

06:16.560 --> 06:18.350
I'm not letting you get away!

06:18.350 --> 06:19.810
Damn...!

06:19.810 --> 06:21.770
Miyako, it's dangerous!

06:21.770 --> 06:24.820
Leave her alone. It looks like fun.

06:24.820 --> 06:31.820
The Sun may forgive you but the Sheriff of the Northern City, Toudaiji Miyako, won't!

06:31.820 --> 06:33.780
Now, surrender peacefully!

06:33.780 --> 06:35.780
You insolent...!

06:37.120 --> 06:40.670
Toudaiji...I mean Boss! It's dangerous!

06:40.670 --> 06:43.290
Miyako! I'm helping, too!

06:43.290 --> 06:46.010
Come on, let Miyako handle this.

06:46.010 --> 06:46.630
But...

06:47.590 --> 06:49.010
You bastard!

06:59.350 --> 07:00.730
You'll regret this!

07:01.310 --> 07:02.520
I'm not letting you go!

07:08.190 --> 07:09.950
Get him!

07:12.450 --> 07:14.870
Don't move!

07:14.870 --> 07:17.240
Damn! I won't forget this!

07:21.620 --> 07:23.420
Thank you very much.

07:23.420 --> 07:26.340
Oh, no. This is nothing compared to Jeanne.

07:26.340 --> 07:29.420
Geez, Miyako! You always throw yourself into these situations!

07:29.420 --> 07:32.680
What are you talking about? This was an event.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.640
An event?

07:33.640 --> 07:37.140
See? It says so on the pamphlet.

07:38.270 --> 07:42.020
It's true. This is a toy.

07:42.810 --> 07:44.480
What the...

07:44.480 --> 07:47.480
What's this you're reading?

07:47.480 --> 07:50.570
Oh, you must be looking forward to this!

07:50.570 --> 07:52.570
Corrupt Chief Magistrate Show?

07:52.570 --> 07:54.320
What is that?

07:54.320 --> 07:55.370
Basically...

07:56.870 --> 08:00.410
Chief Magistrate! Stop, stop!

08:01.500 --> 08:04.790
Come on, come on!

08:04.790 --> 08:07.340
Stop! Stop!

08:07.340 --> 08:10.630
Come on, come on!

08:10.630 --> 08:13.300
Stop! Stop!!!

08:13.300 --> 08:15.640
Come on!!! There!!!

08:19.430 --> 08:21.100
What the hell are you thinking about?!

08:21.100 --> 08:23.060
Really!

08:27.150 --> 08:31.610
I feel it... There's a Demon nearby.

08:33.200 --> 08:34.570
I wonder if it's in this building?

08:40.830 --> 08:44.540
It's definitely in this room! What is the Demon possessing?!

08:58.010 --> 09:00.600
Something happened to Fin-chan! I have to rescue her!

09:16.740 --> 09:18.070
Where am I...?

09:19.950 --> 09:22.620
A caged bird in the fire, I presume.

09:23.620 --> 09:25.750
You can see me?!

09:25.750 --> 09:28.250
Oh yes. I can see you quite well.

09:28.250 --> 09:30.750
So you're the one being possessed by the Demon!

09:30.750 --> 09:33.260
Kaitou Jeanne is here, isn't she?

09:33.260 --> 09:34.800
How would I know?!

09:34.800 --> 09:36.840
What is Jeanne's weakness?

09:36.840 --> 09:40.720
Hmph! I'm not going to tell you!

09:40.720 --> 09:43.600
Even with this?

09:48.810 --> 09:51.230
Stop! It's torture!

09:51.230 --> 09:53.400
Now, answer me!

09:53.400 --> 09:56.200
Jeanne doesn't have a weakness!

09:56.200 --> 09:59.740
Jeanne will come rescue me, no matter what!

09:59.740 --> 10:02.790
She'll seal you for sure!

10:02.790 --> 10:05.080
No matter what?

10:05.080 --> 10:08.120
I see, so that's her weakness.

10:08.120 --> 10:10.380
She's very susceptible...

10:10.380 --> 10:11.210
That's...!

10:14.920 --> 10:16.090
Jeanne...

10:17.050 --> 10:20.850
So... this is Jeanne.

10:20.850 --> 10:25.060
Jeanne, run! The Demon is going to trap...

10:25.060 --> 10:26.480
Jeanne!!!

10:29.060 --> 10:29.850
Fin..

10:31.360 --> 10:34.020
Notice

10:31.360 --> 10:34.020
Don't go away!

10:31.360 --> 10:34.020
I'll return right after these messages!

10:31.360 --> 10:34.020
Kaitou Jeanne

10:34.900 --> 10:37.530
Notice

10:34.900 --> 10:37.530
I'm back to continue my adventures

10:34.900 --> 10:37.530
Kaitou Jeanne

10:45.790 --> 10:48.830
Man, what a mess!

10:48.830 --> 10:53.130
I've gotta tell Sinbad about the Demon and rescue Fin-chan!

10:53.130 --> 10:55.300
- Emer--

10:53.630 --> 10:55.300
- Emergency! Emergency!

10:55.300 --> 10:56.260
Emergency!!!

11:00.180 --> 11:03.390
There was a notice from Kaitou Jeanne!

11:03.390 --> 11:04.010
What?!

11:07.640 --> 11:12.230
Kaitou Jeanne announces that she will steal the famous sword...

11:12.230 --> 11:15.570
"Seigetsu" from the CEO of Kekko Edojidai Mura. What?!

11:15.570 --> 11:16.570
That's...

11:16.570 --> 11:23.070
...possible. As long as there are beautiful things in this world, Jeanne will show up anywhere.

11:23.070 --> 11:24.620
Hachi, let's go!

11:24.620 --> 11:26.620
Um... Where to?

11:26.620 --> 11:31.790
Where else? To arrest Jeanne! No, I mean tie her up!

11:31.790 --> 11:33.460
Boss, wait!

11:34.210 --> 11:36.210
<i>There's a Demon here...</i>

11:36.210 --> 11:38.630
I'm going to the <i>kawaya.</i>

11:38.630 --> 11:40.010
"Kawaya?"

11:40.010 --> 11:41.550
The bathroom.

11:42.090 --> 11:43.220
Take your time.

11:43.220 --> 11:44.010
See ya.

11:44.890 --> 11:46.350
<i>I have to find Fin!</i>

11:57.860 --> 12:01.490
Right this way, CEO- I mean, Your Highness.

12:01.490 --> 12:06.450
The daughter of Inspector Toudaiji, from the Special Jeanne Investigation Force of Momokuri Station, is here to see you.

12:14.960 --> 12:16.170
<i>Jeanne's friends...</i>

12:21.220 --> 12:24.890
This is the famous sword, Seigetsu.

12:28.930 --> 12:34.690
I see. I have contacted my father, but it will take some time for him to arrive.

12:34.690 --> 12:36.650
Until then, I will...

12:36.650 --> 12:38.440
Oh, no!

12:38.440 --> 12:46.450
I apologize but we have plenty of staff on hand, and security is at a maximum, so do not worry.

12:46.450 --> 12:49.410
Even so...! This is Kaitou Jeanne we're talking about!

12:49.410 --> 12:50.950
She'll get through any security...

12:56.080 --> 12:58.290
Huh, where did you come from?!

12:59.300 --> 13:02.880
This is a Ninja Castle, Toudaiji-san.

13:02.880 --> 13:09.550
That's it! Since you've come all this way, why don't I invite you to the Special Room.

13:09.550 --> 13:13.640
Special Room? Is there something unique on display there?

13:13.640 --> 13:16.600
Oh yes. It's a very entertaining room.

13:16.600 --> 13:18.560
U-Um, we...!

13:18.560 --> 13:24.110
Take good care of them. After all, they're very important guests.

13:24.110 --> 13:26.030
Excuse me... Kagaya-san?

13:27.530 --> 13:30.530
Now all the pieces are in place.

13:30.530 --> 13:34.040
<i>Kagaya, you're a bad one, aren't you?</i>

13:34.040 --> 13:36.250
You too, Chief Magistrate.

13:42.550 --> 13:46.970
The famous sword, Seigetsu, is on display at the top of the castle tower.

13:46.970 --> 13:47.720
Okay!

14:01.190 --> 14:03.940
I don't have a chance this way!

14:03.940 --> 14:08.070
Fin! Come on, Fin! Where are you?! Please, answer me!

14:08.910 --> 14:10.370
<i>Fin! Fin!</i>

14:11.450 --> 14:13.660
They call this the Special Room?!

14:13.660 --> 14:16.250
It's just a regular room! Let's get out of here!

14:16.250 --> 14:17.660
I'm with you!

14:18.500 --> 14:21.380
Huh?! Boss, this won't open!

14:21.380 --> 14:24.550
Why?! Are we locked in?!

14:24.550 --> 14:26.090
It looks like it...

14:26.090 --> 14:28.550
No way! Why?!

14:28.550 --> 14:29.970
I don't know!

14:29.970 --> 14:32.720
Open up! Someone!

14:33.970 --> 14:36.480
Fin! Come on, Fin!

14:36.480 --> 14:37.140
Maron!

14:37.140 --> 14:39.440
Fin, where are you?!

14:39.440 --> 14:41.610
I've been captured by the Demon!

14:41.610 --> 14:44.270
Miyako and the Class President are locked up, too!

14:44.270 --> 14:47.190
What?! I'll be right there!

14:47.190 --> 14:51.070
Wait, Maron! The Demon must have traps set up!

14:51.070 --> 14:54.370
Traps? I couldn't care less!

14:54.370 --> 14:56.370
I have to save Miyako and Class President, too.

14:56.370 --> 15:01.040
Please, Fin! I can't fight in this city girl outfit!

15:01.040 --> 15:05.380
Got it. I don't know where you are, but I'll try.

15:17.930 --> 15:19.100
Here it comes! That's it!

15:29.780 --> 15:31.910
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

15:35.530 --> 15:37.490
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

15:37.490 --> 15:39.540
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

15:39.540 --> 15:41.290
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:58.520 --> 15:59.930
She used me as a platform!

16:07.020 --> 16:08.900
This is real!

16:14.950 --> 16:18.830
It's an intruder! Everyone, get out here!

16:18.830 --> 16:21.540
Geez, how many of you guys are there?

16:26.460 --> 16:28.210
Kaitou Jeanne, I presume.

16:28.210 --> 16:33.050
I am Maeda Keiichiro, the Spear Master!

16:33.050 --> 16:37.350
I challenge you to a duel!

16:40.100 --> 16:41.930
You're good...

16:41.930 --> 16:45.770
...but this is as far as you go!

16:46.480 --> 16:47.230
What the...!

16:51.570 --> 16:52.860
H-Heavy...

16:56.240 --> 16:57.910
Damn you!!!

17:04.210 --> 17:08.340
Geez, what's with you today?

17:10.090 --> 17:12.260
Oh no! It's already started!

17:18.970 --> 17:21.810
Kaitou Sinbad has arrived.

17:22.680 --> 17:25.440
Sinbad, I'm not letting you get in my way!

17:26.690 --> 17:28.940
It looks like this isn't the time to be saying that.

17:35.530 --> 17:36.990
There you are!

17:36.990 --> 17:38.160
Sinbad!

17:47.540 --> 17:50.210
No way!!!

17:54.670 --> 17:56.590
Leave this to me.

17:56.590 --> 17:58.510
Stop showing off!

17:58.510 --> 18:00.850
i just don't want you to get hurt. Now go!

18:04.720 --> 18:08.770
I'm not going to owe you anything. We're even now!

18:16.070 --> 18:19.160
This is as far as you go. You think you can beat us all barehanded--

18:19.160 --> 18:21.410
Actually, I do.

18:33.550 --> 18:36.130
What's going on? There's nothing here.

18:38.760 --> 18:39.630
Right there!

18:43.060 --> 18:47.430
You found me, but this is the end of the line.

18:47.430 --> 18:51.900
You think you can seal this?

18:52.400 --> 18:56.690
This is the mechanism to the falling ceiling of the first floor.

18:56.690 --> 18:57.900
Falling ceiling?

18:58.610 --> 19:01.780
That's where the guests are resting.

19:01.780 --> 19:03.030
<i>Miyako! Fin!</i>

19:03.990 --> 19:09.790
Your friends will be crushed in that room if the sword disappears.

19:09.790 --> 19:11.960
Now, seal it if you dare!

19:14.130 --> 19:16.090
Who cares?

19:16.090 --> 19:17.300
Sinbad!

19:17.300 --> 19:21.180
It's none of my concern. I'm going to <i>Checkmate</i> it.

19:21.180 --> 19:22.340
What are you saying?!

19:23.470 --> 19:26.970
Then, I'll send all of you to Hell!

19:28.020 --> 19:28.980
NO!

19:32.810 --> 19:35.150
I wonder what that sound is, Boss?

19:36.440 --> 19:39.190
The ceiling is coming down!

19:40.110 --> 19:45.530
Come on, attack me! I am a master of the Jigenryu Style!

19:46.700 --> 19:50.960
<i>Jigenryu... A suicidal style that allows the opponent to cut the flesh so you can cut the bone.</i>

19:50.960 --> 19:54.500
<i>It's dangerous to get too close.</i>

19:55.670 --> 19:58.460
- What can we do?!

19:55.670 --> 19:58.460
- What are we going to do?!

20:01.550 --> 20:03.930
They're right below... But how...?

20:05.010 --> 20:06.260
We're doomed!

20:06.260 --> 20:08.350
Shut up and keep holding!

20:10.850 --> 20:12.980
Jeanne, help!

20:17.360 --> 20:18.360
Not good enough!

20:19.980 --> 20:21.030
What?!

20:26.280 --> 20:27.660
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:35.250 --> 20:36.710
Now we're really doomed...!

20:36.710 --> 20:38.840
I'm not giving up!!!

20:39.630 --> 20:41.840
Where is everyone?

20:41.840 --> 20:42.670
Ow!

20:46.720 --> 20:48.390
What's going on?

20:48.390 --> 20:49.560
The ceiling is...

20:49.560 --> 20:50.680
...rising...

20:51.100 --> 20:53.640
Geez, that hurt...

20:56.770 --> 20:57.900
It stopped!!!

20:58.270 --> 20:59.860
What's this?

21:01.650 --> 21:02.820
It opened!!!

21:04.950 --> 21:05.820
Jeanne!

21:08.030 --> 21:09.910
This is fun!

21:15.370 --> 21:16.540
Not again!!!

21:32.810 --> 21:34.560
Where's Jeanne?!

21:34.560 --> 21:37.850
I have no clue what's going on...

21:37.850 --> 21:40.570
Huh? What are you guys doing?

21:40.570 --> 21:41.980
What's the matter?

21:41.980 --> 21:46.780
Where have you guys been?! We were in so much trouble!

21:46.780 --> 21:48.320
Uh... Nothing much...

21:48.320 --> 21:50.740
I went to get some rice cakes...

21:50.740 --> 21:52.040
How did you like it?

21:52.910 --> 21:59.250
The Edojidai Mura attractions were filled with suspense, weren't they?

21:59.250 --> 22:01.540
Attraction?!

22:01.540 --> 22:05.010
WE LOOK FORWARD TO SEEING YOU AGAIN!!!

22:05.510 --> 22:11.350
For billions of years,

22:11.430 --> 22:20.900
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.070 --> 22:29.530
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.780 --> 22:35.830
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.450 --> 22:39.250
The huge mountains...

22:41.960 --> 22:48.880
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.380 --> 22:53.930
It took everything.

22:56.180 --> 23:02.150
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.230 --> 23:09.150
we watched the world ending...

23:09.360 --> 23:15.240
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.370 --> 23:25.000
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.680 --> 23:35.010
Fin...are you really leaving?

23:35.010 --> 23:39.890
There are no more Demons. My job is done.

23:39.890 --> 23:40.890
No way...

23:40.890 --> 23:44.940
Maron, I'm sorry I've put you through some dangerous times.

23:44.940 --> 23:50.740
Thank you so much for listening to my wish. Thank you so, so much...

23:50.740 --> 23:55.200
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Tears of Separation with the Angel Fin

23:55.200 --> 24:00.000
Fin, you'll come back...right?
